        <hr style="margin: 4px 0px; width: 100%; border-width: 0; height: 2px; color: #000000; background-color: #000000; clear: both;"/></div>

    </div>

    <div style="text-align: justify; color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">(b) The results of the voting are shown below.</div>

