            <div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;">Votes Against</div>
          </td>

    <td style="width: 3.5%; vertical-align: bottom; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</td>

    <td style="width: 33.34%; vertical-align: bottom; border-bottom: 2px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">
